Z||000002||kel||04-12-99||12:34 PM||||FieroMike<p>Your right, I am OLD!!!  But my son, who's only 19, has seen it too.  In fact he's the one that asked me why they do the "peace" sign!  Maybe it's just in Pennsylvania!  Well I better get back to my rocking chair...JK:) 
