Z||000005||Patrick||04-12-99||03:02 PM||||Well, where I live, we all pretend that we're not even interested in the other person's car. It's quite an art to be able to closely scrutinize somebody else's vehicle without moving one's head. It's definitely an advantage to have good peripheral vision. :)
